        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3c3" value="Read left to right. The &lt;b&gt;Stage&lt;/b&gt; band is the standard command sequence; under each stage, the &lt;b&gt;orange notes&lt;/b&gt; are the files it writes, and dashed arrows are the named hand-offs between them. &lt;b&gt;deploy-notes.md&lt;/b&gt; from feature, bugfix and hotfix feeds the release, selected by fix version." style="text;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="p3c1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="1620" height="40" as="geometry" />
